cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KFRE Risk Map"
abstract: "Browser-based companion tool that calculates 2- and 5-year kidney failure risk with the 4-variable Kidney Failure Risk Equation and sets it against the KDIGO 2024 heat map, with a risk map, action thresholds, driver decomposition and repeat-test simulation."
version: 2.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lamkienthanh92/kfreriskmap"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24150074
keywords:
  - chronic kidney disease
  - kidney failure risk equation
  - KDIGO
  - risk stratification
  - clinical decision support
